**`app/main.py`** — All changes:
1. **`GET /tasks`** — Added `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` query filters (all optional, combinable) and `page`/`page_size` pagination (defaults 1/20, `ge=1` validation)
2. **`POST /tasks`** — Requires auth, validates `project_id` exists (404 if not), auto-generates ID, returns 201 with created task
3. **`PUT /tasks/{task_id}`** — Requires auth, partial update via `TaskUpdate` (only set fields), returns updated task, 404 if not found
